        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gábor Csupó, Dakota Blue Richards, Augustus Prew\n- Films and TV: The Secret of Moonacre, About a Boy, Charlie St. Cloud, The Borgias, Kick-Ass 2, Klondike, Rugrats, Duckman\n- Companies: Klasky Csupo\n\nFacts:\n- Gábor Csupó co-founded the animation studio Klasky Csupo, which produced shows including Rugrats and Duckman.\n- Augustus Prew is known for his role in the film About a Boy from 2002.\n- The film The Secret of Moonacre was directed by Gábor Csupó and starred Dakota Blue Richards in the leading role.\n- Augustus Prew is known for his role in the film The Secret of Moonacre from 2008.\n- Augustus Prew is known for his role in the film Charlie St. Cloud from 2010.\n- Augustus Prew is known for his role in The Borgias from 2011.\n- Augustus Prew is known for his role in the film Kick-Ass 2 from 2013.\n- Augustus Prew is known for his role in the miniseries Klondike from 2014.",
